---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Kurulum" locale="tr" currentPath="/tr/docs/installation">
  <PageHeader title="Kurulum" subtitle="keyflip'i makinenize bir dakikadan kisa surede kurun" />

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4">Gereksinimler</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Node.js 18 veya uzeri</strong> (Claude Code zaten Node gerektirir)</li>
        <li>Claude uygulamasi veya Claude Code, kaydetmek istediginiz hesap(lar)a giris yapilmis</li>
        <li>macOS, Linux veya Windows</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4">macOS / Linux</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-4">Tek satir, npm yok, sudo yok:</p>
      <CodeBlock code='curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hakkisagdic/keyflip/main/install.sh | bash' title="Shell" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-8">Windows</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-4">PowerShell tek satirligi (Baslat Menusu / Masaustu kisayolu olusturur):</p>
      <CodeBlock code='irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hakkisagdic/keyflip/main/install.ps1 | iex' title="PowerShell" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-8">npm ile (tum platformlar)</h2>
      <CodeBlock code={`npm install --global @hakkisagdic/keyflip

# veya dogrudan git'ten (kayit defteri gerekmez):
npm install --global git+https://github.com/hakkisagdic/keyflip.git`} title="npm" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-8">Kaynaktan</h2>
      <CodeBlock code='git clone https://github.com/hakkisagdic/keyflip.git && cd keyflip && ./install.sh' title="Git clone" />

      <div class="mt-8 p-4 bg-primary-50 dark:bg-primary-950/50 border border-primary-200 dark:border-primary-800 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300">
          Yukleyici kodu <code>~/.local/share/keyflip</code>'e yerlestirir, <code>keyflip</code>'i <code>~/.local/bin</code>'e baglar ve <code>PATH</code>'inize ekler. <code>./uninstall.sh</code> ile kaldirilir (veya <code>npm uninstall -g keyflip</code>).
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-8">Ilk kurulum</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-4">Tum hesaplarinizi yakalamak icin rehberli sihirbazi calistirin:</p>
      <CodeBlock code='keyflip setup' title="Kurulum sihirbazi" />
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300">
        Su anda ne giris yapmissaniz onu kaydeder, sonra dongu yapar: bir sonraki hesabiniza giris/cikis yapin ve keyflip yeni girisi otomatik algilar. Bittiginizde <code>d</code> yazin.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4">
        <a href="/tr/docs/usage" class="px-6 py-2 bg-primary-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors">
          Sonraki: Kullanim &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
